<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2PE" style="id">- Benamanga Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Peteli</para>
  <para style="toc1">Baluwa lya uvili lya Peteli</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Peteli</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 Pet</para>
  <para style="mt2">Baluwa lya uvili lya</para>
  <para style="mt1">Peteli</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongolelo</para>
  <para style="ip">Baluwa lya uvili lya Peteli ihumulila kuva isimbiliwe na Mnjagila Peteli, ila vakwimba volofu va figono ifi sevadikila kuva lukani ulu ndi lya undakyene. Iwesekana kuva munu yungi asimbile badili lya Peteli.</para>
  <para style="ip">Munu yeasimbile baluwa iyi ihumulila kuva mwene akali mswida yeawonile maisa ga Yesu na hilo chipindi peaseduke wuso. Musula lya 1.17-18. Ngita Peteli yeasimbile baluwa iyi, suwe iwesekana asimbile akiva ukoya ku Loma mwiso va myaka gya sitini peali ave Peteli seafuwe na peababilwe suwe Yesu Kilisito. Kangi Peteli akuikemela baluwa lyake iyo lya uvili. Musula lya 3.1, yeakaisimbile peasimbile yila ya lya Peteli va kwanja na akasimbile baluwa iyi kwa vala vevamdikiye Kilisito vonda.</para>
  <para style="ip">Peteli asimbile baluwa iyi neke kuvanamache vanu vevamdikiye Kilisito vakale kwa unofu na kuvalakilila vabihile kuvafwata vawulanicha va udesi, musula lya 2. Akuvagangamacha vanu vabihile kuvadikila vanu vevilonga kuva Yesu agehe molemole kuwuya. Pambele ihumulila kuva Nguluvi seagehe molemole ila isaka vanu vonda valowolwe, musula lya 3.8-9. Iyi ndi kwakuva lya kwikala maisa manofu gegikumpesa Nguluvi, musula lya 3.14.</para>
  <para style="iot">Gegagehe</para>
  <para style="io">Peteli ikwiyitambucha yemwene na avatambuche vakwimba, musula lya 1.1-2.</para>
  <para style="io">Baho akuvawiwusa kwikala maisa manofu kwakuva Nguluvi akututanga tukale ndeni, musula lya 1.3-2.</para>
  <para style="io">Pambele akuvalakila kutiya kuvafwata vawulanicha va udesi na kulonga ndi kinu liki dakivahumila vawulanicha va udesi mu figono fya mwiso. Musula lya 2.1-22.</para>
  <para style="io">Pambele Peteli akumalila kwa kuvagangamalicha vanu vevamdike Yesu kwikala maisa manofu vakiyidima kwa kwacha kangi kwa Yesu Kilisito, musula lya 3.1-17.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2PE 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2PE 1:1" />Nene Simoni Peteli, mnyingendwa na mnjagila va Yesu Kilisito.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2PE 1:1">Ndikuvasimbiliya nyenye yemumdikiye Yesu Kilisito, kwa undakyene va Nguluvi vetu na Mlowa vetu Yesu Kilisito, muwanuke udikilo wulawula va galama ngomi yetuwanuke nefwe.<verse eid="2PE 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2PE 1:2" />Ndikuvang'ang'ila usangi va Nguluvi na lutengamaso kwa kumchela Nguluvi na Yesu Mtwa vetu.<verse eid="2PE 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muhaguliwe na kukemelwa na Nguluvi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2PE 1:3" />Kwa umwimike vake Nguluvi katugavila nefwe ahadi ngomi na figehe na galama yeatukemele kwa ukomi vake na usangi vake mwene. <verse eid="2PE 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2PE 1:4" />Ndeni, atugavile ahadi lyake ngomi na lya galama, neke kwa kuchumbila ago muveche pamwi kwa kwikala kwa kumfwatila Nguluvi na muyiyepe kuhuma mu uyagilo va mu inyi kwakuva lya ludobokelo chihafu. <verse eid="2PE 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2PE 1:5" />Kwa ndeni, mugangamale hilo mu usangi venu kuhongelecha usanzi venu na mu usanzi venu muhongeleche luhala, <verse eid="2PE 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2PE 1:6" />na luhala venu muwese kuyilongocha mwavene na mu kuyilongocha mwongeleche uhuvililo na uhuvililo venu mwongeleche kwa kumchela Nguluvi, <verse eid="2PE 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2PE 1:7" />na kumchela Nguluvi mwongeleche lukelo lwa ukolo na mulukelo lwa ukolo mwongeleche lukelo. <verse eid="2PE 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2PE 1:8" />Makani aga gyonda pegivecha kwa nyenye kwa wolofu, semuvesa vagata na dayasevakanila kugita makani manofu mu kumchela Mtwa vetu Yesu Kilisito. <verse eid="2PE 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2PE 1:9" />Ila munu yeihela finu ifyo seilola patali na abofwike meho na asemwile kuva ahechilwe sambi chake cha daha.<verse eid="2PE 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2PE 1:10" />Suwe, vakolo vangu, mugangamale hilo kuwugita kukemelwa na kuhaguliwe na Nguluvi na pemwigite ndeni semuguwa ha, <verse eid="2PE 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2PE 1:11" />na kwa kugita ndeni damwikwanukwa unofu na kwingila mu ung'achale va mbepali va Mtwa na Mlowa vetu Yesu Kilisito.<verse eid="2PE 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2PE 1:12" />Ndeni, dandikuvawiwusa njowo ichi figono fyonda, ata ngita mwichela na mugehe vakangamafu mu undakyene vemuwanuke. <verse eid="2PE 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2PE 1:13" />Ndihocha ndi lukani lunofu kwa nene, chipindi chonda chindikwikala baha painyi, <verse eid="2PE 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2PE 1:14" />Kwakuva ndichela kuva chipindi cha kufuwa chigehe pepi, ngita Mtwa vetu Yesu Kilisito peandongiye wachiwachi. <verse eid="2PE 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2PE 1:15" />Na nene dandigita kwa ukangamafu neke pendifua muwese kuwiwuka makani aga figono fyonda.<verse eid="2PE 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vaswida va Ukomi va Kilisito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2PE 1:16" />Chipindi petuvawulanicha ukomi vake Yesu Kilisito na kwacha kwa mwene, setukafwatile humulilo chechitungilwe kwa usugu, ili nefwe ndi vaswida va ukomi vake. <verse eid="2PE 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2PE 1:17" />Kwakuva akapatile uginyange na ukomi kuhuma kwa Nguluvi Daada, chipindi lichwi pelimwachiye kuhuma kwa Nguluvi yeagehe na ukomi ikalongie, “Uyu ndi Mwana vangu yendimkeliye, yendikeliswa nave.” <verse eid="2PE 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2PE 1:18" />Na lichwi ilyo tukaipulike kuhuma kuluhano kwa Nguluvi petugehe pamwi na mwene kukyanya lya kila kidunda kya Nguluvi. <verse eid="2PE 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2PE 1:19" />Ndeni ndeni, tugehe na njowo chevasimbile daha na vavichi va Nguluvi, gilonga undakyene, na nyenye ngamgita unofu ngita ngamupulikicha, ngita fila chibatali cheching'alika mukisi mbaka kukiye na nondwa lya pamilau ing'aliche munumbula chenu. <verse eid="2PE 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2PE 1:20" />Pautalo lya njowo chonda wiwuke kuva kuhela uvichi mu masimbo gyegihumila na uganulo va ngita akela mvichi yumwene, <verse eid="2PE 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2PE 1:21" />ila vanu valongile njowo icho chechihuma kwa Nguluvi ngita ndeni valongwichwe na Muhe va Nguluvi.<verse eid="2PE 1:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2PE 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2PE 2" />
  <para style="s">Vawulanichi va udesi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2PE 2:1" />Pakahumie vavichi va udesi pagati pa vanu na pamwi na vawulanicha va udesi davahumila mugati lyenu. Vanu ava davaingicha mawulanichi gya udesi gya kuyagicha vanu na kumlema Mtwa yeavakombuwe na davakwiletela uhanango bahobaho vawo vavene. <verse eid="2PE 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2PE 2:2" />Kangi vanu volofu davachifwata makani gyawo mahofu na kwakuva iyo vangi davachibeda ng'asi cha undakyene. <verse eid="2PE 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2PE 2:3" />Mu ludoboko lyawo lya davayipatila mali kuhuma kwa nyenye kwa kuvalongela makani gya udesi. Kuhigwa nongwa kwavo kukalanduchwe kuhuma pamwandi na kuhanagwa kwavo kukuvachindila!<verse eid="2PE 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2PE 2:4" />Ngita Nguluvi seavawonile lusungu vandumindumi pevagitile sambi, ila akavatagile mulyoto weseuchima na vawopilwe ndegeyi gya kyuma mukisi hilo vakichindila kigono kila kya kuhigwa nongwa. <verse eid="2PE 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2PE 2:5" />Ndeni ndeni ngita Nguluvi seakaiwoniye lusungu inyi baho pamwandi, ila akaletile ulava likomi mu inyi lya vanu vikwikala bila kumuwidikila mwene, ila akamuwokola Nuhu yeakali akidalika undakyene pamwi na vanu vangi saba. <verse eid="2PE 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2PE 2:6" />Ndeni ndeni Nguluvi akachitovile vanu va mwani gya Sodoma na Gomola kwa kuginyanya lyoto, iveche kimanyilo kwa makani dachikuvapata vanu vevikwikala bila kumuwidikila mwene. <verse eid="2PE 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2PE 2:7" />Akamlowa Lutu, munu msanzi, yeakali ing'ung'ulichwe hilo na makani gya ugoni gya vanu vahofu. <verse eid="2PE 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2PE 2:8" />Kwakuva Lutu akali akwikala pamwi na vene, kila kigono akasugwime hilo mu numbula lyake yeihaguliwe kwajili lya Nguluvi na peapulike na kugalola makani gyao mahofu. <verse eid="2PE 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2PE 2:9" />Ngita ndeni, Mtwa achela namuna lya kuvalowa vanu vevikwikala kwa kumuwidikila mwene kuhuma mumagecho na namuna lya kuvavika vawofu mumagudo neke akavatove kigono kya kuhigwa nongwa, <verse eid="2PE 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2PE 2:10" />hilo vala vanu vevifwata ludoboko luhafu lwa mvili na kubeda mamulaka gya Nguluvi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2PE 2:10">Vanu ava vasugu na vikwidumba, vakufiliga na sevakuvaginya fiwumbe fyefigehe na ukomi va kuluhano, <verse eid="2PE 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2PE 2:11" />ila ata vandumindumi vana umwimike na ludali kuchumba avo vawulanichi va udesi, sevakuvaliga fiwumbe avo chipindi vakuvalata pautalo lwa Mtwa. <verse eid="2PE 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2PE 2:12" />Ila vanu avo viliga kyokyonda kila sevakichela, ava ngita vang'oko vihela luhala ambavo vababwa neke vabatwe na kuhinjwa, vanu avo sevichela yula yevakumlinga na ndeni vihanangwa ngita vang'oko, <verse eid="2PE 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2PE 2:13" />vihombwa magudo kwa gala magudo gyevavagitile vangi. Vavene vilola lya kuva nde unofu kuita ugoni pamunyi pee. Ndeni vawo ndi ngita mavifyu na vileta nyoni chipindi vikwiwunga na nyenye mu lihungu kuno vikwendelela na ng'asi chawo cha udesi. <verse eid="2PE 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2PE 2:14" />Vidoboka ugoni, sevileka kugita sambi. Vekuvayovelecha vala vanu vevagehe vasosuvafu mbaka mumtego va sambi. Vavene ndi vanu vesevigwita na ndi kilelo kyekikotoliwe na Nguluvi. <verse eid="2PE 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2PE 2:15" />Vavene nde valekile ng'asi nofu na vakafwatile ng'asi njanganifu, vakafwatile ng'asi yila yila lya Balamu, yeakali mwana va Bioli, yeakeliye kuhombwa kwa kugita unjanganifu, <verse eid="2PE 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2PE 2:16" />ila alakiliwe kwajili lya uhofu vake. Lipunda yeseilonga, akalongile kwa lichwi lya munu, akaupecha lukwale lwa uyo mvichi.<verse eid="2PE 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2PE 2:17" />Vanu avo ndi ngita kilwita chechigamile, ndi ngita mafunde gyegipugwa na litungu, vanu ava umalilo vawo ndi likisi totolo. <verse eid="2PE 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2PE 2:18" />Vakwinjuma kwa njowo chechihela mana na kwa ludoboko chawo chiwofu vakuvahovelecha vala ambavo ndeni pepi vahumile mu vala vevigita magito mawofu. <verse eid="2PE 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2PE 2:19" />Vawulanichi avo va udesi vakuvalongela vanu kuva davavecha pekesu, ila vawo vavene vawopilwe na sambi, kwakuva munu ndi msutu va finu fyonda fyefikumlongocha. <verse eid="2PE 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2PE 2:20" />Ngita davayepile makani gya uwofu gya inyi iyi kwa kuhuma kwa kumchela Mtwa na Mlowa vetu Yesu Kilisito na kangi viwuya kwihanganisa na makani agyo na kulemwa na makani ago. Kyanda kyawo daivecha njanganifu hilo kuchumba lya pamwandi. <verse eid="2PE 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2PE 2:21" />Ngaivecha ngiba kwa veni kuva sevangeichela ng'odo ng'asi lya undakyene, kuchumba pevaichelile vailemile lagicho lya Nguluvi gyevagavilwe. <verse eid="2PE 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2PE 2:22" />Kyevagitile kiwana na ng'ombelo yeilonga, “Libuwa huwuya kuliya gala fyelokuwe” Na ng'ombelo yingi yeilonga, “Ngubi yeagofichwe pambele iwuya kangi kugalawuka mumadope.”<verse eid="2PE 2:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2PE 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2PE 3" />
  <para style="s">Kilongo kya kuwuya Mtwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2PE 3:1" />Vaganja vangu, iyi ndi baluwa lya uvili yendivasimbiye. Baluwa chonda chivili ndigechile kuvawiwusa muveche na mahocho manofu gegikumkelesa Nguluvi. <verse eid="2PE 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2PE 3:2" />Ndisaka mugavuviwuke njowo chechilongilwe na vavichi vevidikilwe pautalo lya Nguluvi na muwiwuke yila lagilicho lya Mtwa na Mlowa vetu gyemgavilwe kuchumbila kwa vanjagila vanu. <verse eid="2PE 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2PE 3:3" />Kwanja muchele kuva figono fya mwiso davakwacha vanu vevilongochwa na ludoboko njanganifu, <verse eid="2PE 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2PE 3:4" />vakilonga, “Akavalongiye kuva daiwuya! Nondee agehe kwiya? Kuhuma pevafuwe vakuuku vetu, finu fyendelie ndeni ndeni ngita pekikali kikwendelela kuhuma peiwumbilwe inyi.” <verse eid="2PE 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2PE 3:5" />Vanu ava kwa dadi lyao husemwa kuva daha Nguluvi alongile luchowo hela nacho luhano na inyi chikawumbilwe. Inyi ikawumbilwe kuhuma mu malenga, <verse eid="2PE 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2PE 3:6" />na kangi kuchumbila kwa malenga ago gya ulava, inyi lya chipindi chila ikwanangilwe. <verse eid="2PE 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2PE 3:7" />Ndeni luchowo ulo ulo lwa Nguluvi akavika lifunde na inyi lya nondee chivikilwe kwajili lya kigono kya kuhigwa nongwa na kudochwa kwa vanu vonda sevamdikiye Nguluvi.<verse eid="2PE 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2PE 3:8" />Ila vaganja vangu, mubihile kusemuwa lukani limwi ilyi kuva kwa Mtwa kigono kimwi ndi ngita miyaka elufu yimwi na miyaka elufu yimwi ndi ngita kigono kimwi. <verse eid="2PE 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2PE 3:9" />Mtwa seigita molemole kugita gala gyeavalongiye, ngita vanu vangi pevihocha kuva igita molemole. Ila Mtwa akuvahuvilila nyenye, kwakuva seikela ata munu venu ayage, ila huvakwega kwa mwene neke vahongeche.<verse eid="2PE 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2PE 3:10" />Ila kigono daiwuya Mtwa, ngita muhichi peikwacha. Kigono ikyo, luhano chiyaga kwa mdilimo va lichwi likomi, fiwumbe fyonda fyefigehe pa lifunde finyanywa lyoto. Na inyi iyaga na finu fyonda fyefigehe mugati lyake fipiya na lyoto. <verse eid="2PE 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2PE 3:11" />Ngita finu fyonda finyanywa kwa namuna iyo. Nondee, wuli nyenye mwing'ang'wa kuva vanu va namuna liki? Mwing'ang'wa kwikala maisa gegahaguliwe kwajili lya Nguluvi na kuwidikila mwene, <verse eid="2PE 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2PE 3:12" />pemukukichindila kigono kila kya Nguluvi na kuigita ikwache kisatu, kwakuva kigono ikyo lifunde dalinyanywa lyoto na fiwumbe fyonda fyefigehe mu lifunde dafinyanywa na lyoto. <verse eid="2PE 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2PE 3:13" />Ila ngita peakatulongie tukuichundila lifunde limiya na inyi miya ambapo vanu vigita hela gala gegakumkelesa Nguluvi.<verse eid="2PE 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2PE 3:14" />Ndeni, vaganja vangu, pemugehe muchindila kigono kila, mugangamache hilo kuva vasanzi mubihile kuva na uvifyi vala nongwa na kuva na lutengamaso na mwene. <verse eid="2PE 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2PE 3:15" />Mwing'ang'wa kuchela uhuvililo va Mtwa vetu nde ukuvagita vanu mulowolwe ngita ndeni likolo veyu yetukelie Paulo peavasimbiye kuhumila na uginyange weagavilwe, <verse eid="2PE 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2PE 3:16" />ngita peilonga pakyanya lya makani aga mu baluwa chake chonda. Makani gangi mu baluwa ichi ndi ngakafu kuchela na makani ambagyo vanu vapufi na sevadikilwa, vanu ava uhecha mana lya kuvayagicha vanu kwa masimbo gangi. Ila kwa kugita ndeni vakwiyanangika vavene.<verse eid="2PE 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2PE 3:17" />Vaganja vangu, muchelile suwe makani aga, ndeni muyidime. Vabihile kuvakwega na vanu ava vahofu sevifwata malagicho na mulemwe kukolela undakyene. <verse eid="2PE 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2PE 3:18" />Ila mukule mu usanzi na kumchela Mtwa na Mlowa vetu Yesu Kilisito. Ukomi ndi vake, nondee na ata mbepali! Ndakyene.<verse eid="2PE 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2PE 3" />
</usx>